{"unit_id":"cnctem__dsh-acp#feature-1","repo":"cnctem/dsh-acp","commit":"1b369d3128d743610841b9307e5b65358de849ef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-acp 的功能「ACP 会话管理」：在编辑器端创建、恢复、列出和关闭 DSH agent 会话，并支持提示与取消。通过 ACP session 请求触发，返回会话标识及配置选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:223-258","src/index.ts:266-300"]}
